# GNOME Shell extensions downloaded from extensions.gnome.org at build time and
# installed system-wide. The newest release compatible with the image's GNOME
# version is used; if there is none yet, the extension is skipped.
# Enable/disable defaults live in branding/.../90_uwubuntu.gschema.override.

burn-my-windows@schneegans.github.com                 # fiery/glitchy window open + close effects
compiz-windows-effect@hermes83.github.com             # wobbly windows
compiz-alike-magic-lamp-effect@hermes83.github.com    # magic lamp minimise
blur-my-shell@aunetx                                  # frosted-glass panel, overview and dock
